":"메모리","x":1222,"y":955,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"스*(memory","x":1348,"y":957,"width":252,"height":42},{"text":"stall)ol","x":1619,"y":959,"width":111,"height":42}]},{"text":"라고 하는 이 상황은 최신 프로세서가 메모리보다 훨씬 빠른 속도로 작동하기 때문에 주","words":[{"text":"라고","x":336,"y":1018,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"하는","x":419,"y":1018,"width":71,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":504,"y":1017,"width":30,"height":38},{"text":"상황은","x":551,"y":1017,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"최신","x":670,"y":1018,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"프로세서가","x":752,"y":1017,"width":174,"height":39},{"text":"메모리보다","x":939,"y":1018,"width":175,"height":39},{"text":"훨씬","x":1128,"y":1019,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"빠른","x":1211,"y":1019,"width":71,"height":38},{"text":"속도로","x":1296,"y":1019,"width":110,"height":37},{"text":"작동하기","x":1421,"y":1018,"width":147,"height":38},{"text":"때문에","x":1588,"y":1019,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"주","x":1704,"y":1025,"width":29,"height":37}]},{"text":"로 발생한다. 그러나 개시 미스(개시 메모리에 없는 데이터를 액세스)로 인해 메모리 스","words":[{"text":"로","x":333,"y":1086,"width":36,"height":29},{"text":"발생한다.","x":384,"y":1081,"width":148,"height":39},{"text":"그러나","x":549,"y":1081,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"개시","x":669,"y":1082,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"미스(개시","x":753,"y":1081,"width":146,"height":43},{"text":"메모리에","x":918,"y":1082,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"없는","x":1074,"y":1083,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"데이터를","x":1157,"y":1083,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"액세스)로","x":1315,"y":1082,"width":162,"height":41},{"text":"인해","x":1496,"y":1082,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"메모리","x":1585,"y":1082,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"스","x":1703,"y":1089,"width":28,"height":30}]},{"text":"톨이 발생할수도 있다. 그림 5.12는 메모리 스톨을 묘사한다. 이 시나리오에서 프로세서","words":[{"text":"톨이","x":332,"y":1147,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"발생할수도","x":417,"y":1146,"width":187,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":619,"y":1146,"width":75,"height":38},{"text":"그림","x":708,"y":1147,"width":66,"height":37}